            "description": "Automation playbook (PB7), kept inactive: an analyst runs it from the case with Run Playbook. Asks the analyst who launched it for a comment, then assigns the TRAP incident to the team and assignee set in the format blocks trap team and trap assignee, moves it from new to open, posts the comment and adds a note. An unanswered prompt does nothing."
